OL,3,ACatering giant to switch main share    
OL,4,Alisting to US in further blow to UK    
OL,6,FCatering giant Compass Group is        
OL,7,Fplanning to switch its primary stock   
OL,8,Fmarket listing from the UK to the US in
OL,9,Fa move which will deal another blow to 
OL,10,Fthe London Stock Exchange.             
OL,12,FA source close to the company told the 
OL,13,FBBC an official announcement was       
OL,14,Fexpected to be made in its full-year   
OL,15,Fresults on Tuesday.                    
OL,17,FCompass Group is made up of several    
OL,18,Fbrands which supply food and drink to  
OL,19,Fvarious places, ranging from football  
OL,20,Fstadiums and visitor attractions to    
OL,21,Fschools, universities and large        
OL,22,Fcorporations.                          
