OL,3,ACatering giant to switch main share    
OL,4,Alisting to US in further blow to UK    
OL,6,FIt is understood the proposed shift to 
OL,7,Fthe US, which was first reported by the
OL,8,FFinancial Times, is being made due to  
OL,9,Fthe number of investors and the        
OL,10,Fincreasing business Compass has across 
OL,11,Fthe Atlantic.                          
